Hi Hynek,

Thanks for bringing this to my attention. I don't recall ever using form B. in fscores(), though if it did that lifespan must have been short. In any case, I'm happy to make the change for ML/WLE estimation as you're correct the var(theta) really is missing the prior probability component. I'll push the change to the dev version shortly.

Phil

